What differs from upstream
--------------------------

Not vendored: the mpnn, tr, rf, seq and esm_msa submodules, and the model weights
that shipped inside them. GuideFlip uses only the AlphaFold design protocols.

Modified, two files:

  colabdesign/__init__.py   drops the two imports that named the submodules above.

  colabdesign/af/prep.py    preserves residue-range rm_binder masks unless
                            use_binder_template is explicitly supplied.

Everything else under af/ and shared/ is upstream's, byte for byte, apart from the
Apache licence text added at af/alphafold/LICENSE.
